<title>UK: UK's United buys interest in Texas oil field.</title>
<headline>UK's United buys interest in Texas oil field.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>British energy group United Energy Plc said on Tuesday its subsidiary AmBrit Energy Corp. had bought a 100 percent working interest in Pardue oil field in Texas from Boyd &amp; McWilliams for $1.1 million.</p>
<p>United said the Pardue Field had net proven reserves of 254 million barrels of oil equivalent and identified probable reserves of 249 mboe.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 4017</p>
